## Context

Filter deploy mission (completed 2026-03-18) added ADV sizing + graduated pump filters to
s56, s60, s69, s76. The remaining 9 strategies in the paper trader run WITHOUT these filters.

Key lesson from the first deploy: filter parameters are strategy-specific. s56 and s60 had
different optimal pump thresholds (s56: 15/25/40, s60: 25/40/60) because s60 is more
aggressive perp momentum that benefits from wider thresholds.

