## Kill Criteria

- If filters degrade OOS Calmar for a strategy → that strategy gets ADV sizing only (no pump)
- If ADV sizing alone degrades OOS Calmar → investigate (shouldn't happen — ADV sizing only reduces size on illiquid tokens)
